rved to be made into HD\",\"uploadDate\":\"2015-06-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Character Voices Song"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Back in 2004 I put together a little audio demo of some of my character voices. </p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Check out the video</h2>\r\n<p>Now whilst I realise some of these are a little dated, I thought it deserved to be made into HD as a couple of producers reminded me of it and how much they liked it. This was a while ago, but I still like a lot of these impressions. Most of them were pretty bang on, even back in 2004! Give it a watch and see what you think. If you'd like to listen o more of my character voices, check out my <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">character showreel</a> and perhaps my most famous impression: my <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\"  title=\"David Attenborough Voiceover\">David Attenborough voice</a>.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/k7DZFWnOcvo","title":"Character Voices Song","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/character-voices-song.jpg","alt":"Character Voices Song","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Character Voices Song</h2>\r\n<p>This is something thats on my list of things to update and produce a new version with some of the newer characters I can now do. However, I think there are plenty in here that are still pretty relevant and popular today as they were back then. When work slows down and I find several hours spare to write, voice, and record it, I will do. A lot of people ask me how I do impressions and the quickest answer is practice. The longer answer is that I listen to everyone and just have a lot of fun trying to sound like them. If you're having fun, practice never really feels like practice!</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for some impressions for your next show or <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a>? Just <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a> and tell me more about your project. If it helps, I can provide you with a sample of your script to help you hear whether I'm right for your project.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Character Voices Song","pageUrl":"character-voices-song"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","671",{"href":"/mmx-hill-climb-trailer-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/mmx-hill-climb-trailer-voiceover.jpg","alt":"MMX Hill Climb Trailer Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"MMX Hill Clim